    <string name="how_to_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="how_to">Play media from a compatible app and tap Start dubbing. If the source app and Android allow playback capture, audio is sent to Gemini for live dubbing. Some apps, DRM-protected media and calls cannot be captured. This feature requires internet access and a valid API key.</string>
